        "heading": "1. Installing MetaTrader on Android & iOS",
        "level": 2,
        "content": "MetaTrader is available for free on both the Google Play Store (Android) and the Apple App Store (iOS):\n\n\u2022 Android Installation: Open Google Play Store, search for 'MetaTrader 4' or 'MetaTrader 5', tap Install, and launch the application.\n\u2022 iOS Installation: Open App Store, search for 'MetaTrader 5', download, and open.\n\u2022 Connecting Your Broker: In the Accounts tab, tap the '+' icon, search for your brokerage server name (e.g., Exness, IC Markets, Pepperstone), enter your Login ID and Password, and choose between Demo or Live server."
