    "contentHtml": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEihrpL3l121SWElbMKW3vWnV9pu8WGO5oLnbXDeqZYhCVyOWZFDD1d34vWFok8QLxUj4w_k-pb4g4MrDhaAc_MOMptEes5GulChg8Nn1IBwRFrXXpamUASw3rMnGHu4Tu1i8D1Qbb9y_J2ofG7aPAQ4mmFSqxRJKfODW6tsbHbtzBgQuEI9UFDAb71GfQ/s870/MT5_Banner_Home.jpg\" style=\"clear: left; display: block; float: left; padding: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"414\" data-original-width=\"870\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEihrpL3l121SWElbMKW3vWnV9pu8WGO5oLnbXDeqZYhCVyOWZFDD1d34vWFok8QLxUj4w_k-pb4g4MrDhaAc_MOMptEes5GulChg8Nn1IBwRFrXXpamUASw3rMnGHu4Tu1i8D1Qbb9y_J2ofG7aPAQ4mmFSqxRJKfODW6tsbHbtzBgQuEI9UFDAb71GfQ/s200/MT5_Banner_Home.jpg\" width=\"200\" /></a></div>\n\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdYW-6eayDwzB2AyIkjKSGWzBpxfO6A5MWe5nwNjpjpIw7reupx-WnzPwwpwwNRqTgTQeHWmn-hoMq2FBsTjdgsD1hAgOVrAxlolfsku1u7ps8aobsF1ZKxBrsVMeS1-EGyk-zuS4JAJwdFZQXLegZVx4mGKOve_M4gtz6fVAgxUVQzpyPc84I8ZvQIw/s1200/logo-preview.png\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0; text-align: center; clear: right; float: right;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" width=\"200\" data-original-height=\"630\" data-original-width=\"1200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdYW-6eayDwzB2AyIkjKSGWzBpxfO6A5MWe5nwNjpjpIw7reupx-WnzPwwpwwNRqTgTQeHWmn-hoMq2FBsTjdgsD1hAgOVrAxlolfsku1u7ps8aobsF1ZKxBrsVMeS1-EGyk-zuS4JAJwdFZQXLegZVx4mGKOve_M4gtz6fVAgxUVQzpyPc84I8ZvQIw/s200/logo-preview.png\"/></a></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <h1>Installing MetaTrader and TradingView on Android and iOS</h1>\n  \n  <h2>Installing MetaTrader on Android:</h2>\n  <ol>\n    <li>Open the Google Play Store on your Android device.</li>\n    <li>In the search bar, type \"MetaTrader\" and tap on the official MetaTrader app.</li>\n    <li>Tap the \"Install\" button to begin the installation process.</li>\n    <li>Once the installation is complete, open the MetaTrader app.</li>\n    <li>If you already have a MetaTrader account, enter your login credentials and tap \"Sign In.\" Otherwise, tap \"Create a new account\" to register.</li>\n    <li>Follow the on-screen instructions to set up your account and configure your preferences.</li>\n    <li>You're now ready to use MetaTrader on your Android device.</li>\n  </ol>\n  \n  <h2>Installing MetaTrader on iOS:</h2>\n  <ol>\n    <li>Open the App Store on your iOS device.</li>\n    <li>In the search bar, type \"MetaTrader\" and tap on the official MetaTrader app.</li>\n    <li>Tap the \"Get\" button to download and install the app.</li>\n    <li>Once the installation is complete, open the MetaTrader app.</li>\n    <li>If you already have a MetaTrader account, enter your login credentials and tap \"Sign In.\" Otherwise, tap \"Create a new account\" to register.</li>\n    <li>Follow the on-screen instructions to set up your account and configure your preferences.</li>\n    <li>You can now start using MetaTrader on your iOS device.</li>\n  </ol>\n  \n  <h2>Installing TradingView on Android:</h2>\n  <ol>\n    <li>Open the Google Play Store on your Android device.</li>\n    <li>In the search bar, type \"TradingView\" and tap on the official TradingView app.</li>\n    <li>Tap the \"Install\" button to begin the installation process.</li>\n    <li>Once the installation is complete, open the TradingView app.</li>\n    <li>If you already have a TradingView account, enter your logincredentials and tap \"Sign In.\" Otherwise, tap \"Sign Up\" to create a new account.</li>\n    <li>Follow the on-screen instructions to set up your account and configure your preferences.</li>\n    <li>You can now start using TradingView on your Android device.</li>\n  </ol>\n  \n  <h2>Installing TradingView on iOS:</h2>\n  <ol>\n    <li>Open the App Store on your iOS device.</li>\n    <li>In the search bar, type \"TradingView\" and tap on the official TradingView app.</li>\n    <li>Tap the \"Get\" button to download and install the app.</li>\n    <li>Once the installation is complete, open the TradingView app.</li>\n    <li>If you already have a TradingView account, enter your login credentials and tap \"Sign In.\" Otherwise, tap \"Sign Up\" to create a new account.</li>\n    <li>Follow the on-screen instructions to set up your account and configure your preferences.</li>\n    <li>You're now ready to use TradingView on your iOS device.</li>\n  </ol>\n  \n  <p>These instructions should help you install MetaTrader and TradingView on both Android and iOS devices. Remember to search for the official apps on the respective app stores to ensure you download the correct and safe applications.</p>",
    "plainText": "Installing MetaTrader and TradingView on Android and iOS Installing MetaTrader on Android: Open the Google Play Store on your Android device. In the search bar, type \"MetaTrader\" and tap on the official MetaTrader app. Tap the \"Install\" button to begin the installation process. Once the installation is complete, open the MetaTrader app. If you already have a MetaTrader account, enter your login credentials and tap \"Sign In.\" Otherwise, tap \"Create a new account\" to register. Follow the on-screen instructions to set up your account and configure your preferences. You're now ready to use MetaTrader on your Android device. Installing MetaTrader on iOS: Open the App Store on your iOS device. In the search bar, type \"MetaTrader\" and tap on the official MetaTrader app. Tap the \"Get\" button to download and install the app. Once the installation is complete, open the MetaTrader app. If you already have a MetaTrader account, enter your login credentials and tap \"Sign In.\" Otherwise, tap \"Create a new account\" to register. Follow the on-screen instructions to set up your account and configure your preferences. You can now start using MetaTrader on your iOS device. Installing TradingView on Android: Open the Google Play Store on your Android device. In the search bar, type \"TradingView\" and tap on the official TradingView app. Tap the \"Install\" button to begin the installation process. Once the installation is complete, open the TradingView app. If you already have a TradingView account, enter your logincredentials and tap \"Sign In.\" Otherwise, tap \"Sign Up\" to create a new account. Follow the on-screen instructions to set up your account and configure your preferences. You can now start using TradingView on your Android device. Installing TradingView on iOS: Open the App Store on your iOS device. In the search bar, type \"TradingView\" and tap on the official TradingView app. Tap the \"Get\" button to download and install the app. Once the installation is complete, open the TradingView app. If you already have a TradingView account, enter your login credentials and tap \"Sign In.\" Otherwise, tap \"Sign Up\" to create a new account. Follow the on-screen instructions to set up your account and configure your preferences. You're now ready to use TradingView on your iOS device. These instructions should help you install MetaTrader and TradingView on both Android and iOS devices. Remember to search for the official apps on the respective app stores to ensure you download the correct and safe applications.",
